Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         gnome-shell (>= 46),
         gnome-shell (<< 52),
         gir1.2-soup-3.0
Description: GNOME Shell indicator for Codex and Claude Code plan usage
 Shows how much of your Codex (ChatGPT) and Claude Code plan quota you have
 used in the GNOME top bar: 5-hour and weekly windows, reset times, plan and
 account for each provider.
 .
 The extension reads the OAuth tokens stored by the codex and claude
 command-line tools; no background service is needed. It is not affiliated
 with OpenAI or Anthropic.
